  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the height of transmitting and receiving antennas are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> each, the maximum line of sight distance will be :</p><p>Given : Earth&rsquo;s radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>.</p>"
  },
